- *                                                                                             *
- * OUTPUT:  none, but this routine might not return at all if the "canretry" parameter is      *
- *          false or the player pressed ESC.                                                   *
- *                                                                                             *
- * WARNINGS:   This routine may not return at all. It handles being in text mode as well as    *
