-;*   Fat_Put_Pixel -- Draws a fat pixel.                                   *
-;*   Conquer_Build_Fading_Table -- Builds custom shadow/light fading table.*
-;*   Remove_From_List -- Removes a pointer from a list of pointers.        *
-;* - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - *
