+/***************************************************************************
+ **      C O N F I D E N T I A L --- W E S T W O O D   S T U D I O S      **
+ ***************************************************************************
+ *                                                                         *
+ *                 Project Name : Westwood 32 bit Library                  *
+ *                                                                         *
+ *                    File Name : SOUNDINT.H                               *
+ *                                                                         *
+ *                   Programmer : Phil W. Gorrow                           *
