+/***********************************************************************************************
+ * Audio_Init -- Initialise the sound system                                                   *
+ *                                                                                             *
+ *                                                                                             *
+ *                                                                                             *
+ * INPUT:    window - window to send callback messages to                                      *
+ *           maximum bits_per_sample - 8 or 16                                                 *
+ *           stereo - will stereo samples be played                                            *
+ *           rate - maximum sample rate required                                               *
