+/***************************************************************************
+ **   C O N F I D E N T I A L --- W E S T W O O D   A S S O C I A T E S   **
+ ***************************************************************************
+ *                                                                         *
+ *                 Project Name : Part of the FILEIO Library               *
+ *                                                                         *
+ *                    File Name : IFF.H                                    *
+ *                                                                         *
+ *                   Programmer : Scott K. Bowen                           *
