+/***************************************************************************
+ **     C O N F I D E N T I A L --- W E S T W O O D   S T U D I O S       **
+ ***************************************************************************
+ *                                                                         *
+ *                 Project Name : Memory System                            *
+ *                                                                         *
+ *                    File Name : MEMFLAG.H                                *
+ *                                                                         *
+ *                   Programmer : Jeff Wilson                              *
+ *                                                                         *
+ *                   Start Date : April 4, 1994                            *
+ *                                                                         *
+ *                  Last Update : September 8, 1994   [IML]                *
+ *                                                                         *
