+/* $Header: g:/library/source/rcs/./windows.c 1.12 1994/05/20 15:35:25 joe_bostic Exp $ */
+/***************************************************************************
+ **   C O N F I D E N T I A L --- W E S T W O O D   A S S O C I A T E S   **
